   623	### 7.1 Decision stage first
   624	
   625	M0 is proposed as a maximum **two engineering person-day desk exercise**,
   626	with no paid agent collection, new acceptance service, or adopter
   627	commitments. Its authorization also names the independent methods reviewer
   628	and budgets review time explicitly against the non-maintainer allowance.
   629	It may precede v0.19; roadmap approval alone does not authorize execution.
   630	
   631	M0 reports recruitment status since Call W as **not attempted**, **attempted
   632	without commitment**, **participant secured**, or **unknown**, with dated
   633	aggregate evidence. Do not equate unattempted/unknown recruitment with a
   634	failed search. Either can leave demand unproven without implying rejection.
   635	
   636	| Approval responsibility | Required owner and decision |
   637	|---|---|
   638	| Resources and investment | Repository maintainer: authorize M0/inquiries, decide resource proposals and final action; no self-approval of independent methodological review. |
   639	| Methods and M0 disposition | Independent methods reviewer: approve scenario rules before calculation, countersign M0, approve estimators and final interpretation. |
